{"seq":2,"slug":"per-language-tuning","title":"按语言调相关性权重","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multilingual-search-engineering/relevance-i18n/per-language-tuning","wordCount":2878,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"按语言调相关性权重\">按语言调相关性权重</h1><p>「同一套排序参数服务所有语言」在多语言索引里必然出问题，原因上一篇已经拆清：长度归一化、IDF 尺度、词项数量都随语言变化，因此同样的字段 boost 与同样的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 在各语言上产生的分数分布并不相同。这一篇给出按语言调参的工程手段：哪些参数值得按语言分开、用什么机制施加、语义检索与词法检索的差异如何处理、以及学习排序在多语言下为什么必须分 locale 训练。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>按语言可调的参数分三个层次，投入递增、收益递减，因此应按顺序推进：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>施加机制</th>\n<th>收益</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字段权重</td>\n<td>各字段/子字段的 boost</td>\n<td>查询时构造 boost，或索引时 <code>boost</code>（已弃用）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BM25 参数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>按字段在映射中设 <code>similarity</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打分函数</td>\n<td>function_score 的各类函数与权重</td>\n<td>查询 DSL 组合</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习排序</td>\n<td>特征权重与模型</td>\n<td>需分 locale 训练与部署</td>\n<td>高（有足够样本时）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[请求进入] --&gt; B{locale 已知?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[加载该语言权重表]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[加载默认权重表]&#10;    C --&gt; E[构造查询]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; E1[字段 boost]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[该语言 similarity k1 b]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[function_score 加权项]&#10;    E1 --&gt; F[执行检索]&#10;    E2 --&gt; F&#10;    E3 --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[结果合并与业务加权]&#10;    G --&gt; H[返回]\">graph TD\n    A[请求进入] --&gt; B{locale 已知?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[加载该语言权重表]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[加载默认权重表]\n    C --&gt; E[构造查询]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; E1[字段 boost]\n    E --&gt; E2[该语言 similarity k1 b]\n    E --&gt; E3[function_score 加权项]\n    E1 --&gt; F[执行检索]\n    E2 --&gt; F\n    E3 --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[结果合并与业务加权]\n    G --&gt; H[返回]</pre><p>这张图强调一个工程事实：<strong>按语言调权重的前提是查询链路里能拿到 locale，并且权重表是可外部配置的</strong>。把权重硬编码在查询 DSL 模板里，等于把「调整泰语权重」变成一次代码发布；把权重放在配置表里，才能让运营与工程师在评测支持下快速迭代。这与字段结构的选择强耦合——按语言分字段或分多子字段时字段级 boost 直接可用，统一字段方案则必须走脚本打分，成本高得多，见 <a href=\"../field-strategy/per-language-fields\">按语言分字段与 multi-field 设计</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"字段-boost-与权重表\">字段 boost 与权重表</h2><p>字段 boost 是最直接的杠杆。对多语言索引，需要按语言调的典型权重项有三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>权重项</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>调参方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语言字段 vs 兜底字段</td>\n<td>专用分析链字段应与统一链字段拉开差距</td>\n<td>兜底字段权重通常是主字段的 1/3 到 1/5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标题 vs 描述</td>\n<td>标题命中的信号更强</td>\n<td>标题权重显著高于描述（常见 2:1 到 5:1）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精确字段 vs 模糊字段</td>\n<td>keyword 或短语精确匹配应高于分词匹配</td>\n<td>精确匹配权重最高，常用 3 倍以上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>权重表的外部化形态通常是一份 per-locale 的 JSON 或配置行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;ja&quot;: { &quot;title.ja&quot;: 4.0, &quot;title.zh_fallback&quot;: 1.0, &quot;desc.ja&quot;: 1.2, &quot;brand_exact&quot;: 6.0 },&#10;  &quot;th&quot;: { &quot;title.th&quot;: 3.0, &quot;title.fallback&quot;: 0.8, &quot;desc.th&quot;: 1.0, &quot;brand_exact&quot;: 6.0 },&#10;  &quot;en&quot;: { &quot;title&quot;: 4.0, &quot;title.cjk&quot;: 1.0, &quot;desc&quot;: 1.5, &quot;brand_exact&quot;: 5.0 }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ja\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"title.ja\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"title.zh_fallback\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"desc.ja\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"brand_exact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"th\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"title.th\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"title.fallback\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"desc.th\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"brand_exact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"en\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"title.cjk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"desc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"brand_exact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份表里值得注意的两处差异：日语给 <code>title.zh_fallback</code>（中文兜底字段）权重 1.0，因为日文商品标题里汉字占比高，中文分词结果对日语查询有实际召回价值；泰语给 <code>title.fallback</code>（统一 ICU 链）只有 0.8，因为泰语分词器覆盖足够，兜底字段主要是防未登录词，不应抢占主字段的排序位置。这类差异不能靠通用直觉推导，必须由该语言的评测集验证。</p>\n<p>权重表的一个常见错误是把它当成「越大越好」的旋钮：把主字段 boost 从 3 提到 10 通常不会提升 nDCG，因为 boost 是相对量，同比例放大所有字段等于没变，只放大一个字段则会破坏召回与精度的平衡。有效的调参方式是固定一个字段为基准值 1.0，只调其余字段的相对值，且每次只调一个维度，用评测集确认方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"按语言设置-bm25-参数\">按语言设置 BM25 参数</h2><p>Lucene 允许在映射中为字段指定 <code>similarity</code>，从而为该字段单独设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>。多语言索引里这个能力有明确的使用场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;settings&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;similarity&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cjk_sim&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;BM25&quot;, &quot;k1&quot;: 1.2, &quot;b&quot;: 0.4 },&#10;      &quot;de_sim&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;BM25&quot;, &quot;k1&quot;: 1.2, &quot;b&quot;: 0.9 }&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;mappings&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;title_ja&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;text&quot;, &quot;analyzer&quot;: &quot;ja_analyzer&quot;, &quot;similarity&quot;: &quot;cjk_sim&quot; },&#10;      &quot;title_de&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;text&quot;, &quot;analyzer&quot;: &quot;de_analyzer&quot;, &quot;similarity&quot;: &quot;de_sim&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"settings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"similarity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cjk_sim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BM25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"k1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"de_sim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BM25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"k1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mappings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"title_ja\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ja_analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"similarity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cjk_sim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"title_de\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"de_analyzer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"similarity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"de_sim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>调参方向有可循的逻辑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 调小（如 0.3–0.5）用于词项数波动大的语言</strong>。CJK bigram 字段是主要对象，因为长标题的词项数被 bigram 放大得最多，过强的长度归一化会与业务直觉冲突（长标题信息更全）。</li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 调大（如 0.8–1.0）用于词项数稳定的语言</strong>。德语复合词标题词项数少且稳定，长度归一化的区分度本来就不大；英语长描述的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 略高有助于压制冗长关键词堆砌。</li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 调小（如 0.9）用于短字段</strong>。电商标题短，词频饱和得快，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 大了没有额外收益；长描述可以保持默认。</li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 调大不常见</strong>，除非有明确的「词项重复出现是强相关信号」的场景（例如规格表里同一词项多次出现）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些方向只是起点，具体值必须由评测集扫描确定，且要注意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 的改变会整体移动分数尺度，若排序中还有跨语言比较，改动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 会影响语言间的相对排位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"function_score-与脚本打分的边界\">function_score 与脚本打分的边界</h2><p>当权重不能靠字段 boost 表达时，才考虑 <code>function_score</code>。它的典型用途有四类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>业务加权（销量、转化率、评分）</td>\n<td><code>field_value_factor</code></td>\n<td>与语言无关，但各语言的数值分布可能不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间衰减（新品、活动）</td>\n<td><code>gauss</code> / <code>exp</code></td>\n<td>与语言无关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言相关的降权（兜底字段打的分）</td>\n<td><code>script_score</code> 或字段级 boost</td>\n<td>能用 boost 就不要用脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合检索（词法分与向量分融合）</td>\n<td><code>script_score</code> 做线性或 RRF 融合</td>\n<td>需要分语言校准两侧尺度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一条实用原则是：<strong>能在字段 boost 表达的，不要用脚本</strong>。脚本打分会失去 Lucene 的查询优化（如 WAND 跳跃），延迟代价明显；且脚本里的权重更难被评测体系覆盖。</p>\n<p>混合检索（词法与向量）在多语言下有一个额外难题：词法分的量级随语言变化（前面说过），向量分的量级相对稳定（取决于模型与归一化方式），因此固定权重融合会让某些语言的排序被词法分或向量分支配。两种可行的处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>按语言校准融合权重</strong>：为每个语言单独设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>lexical</mtext><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>semantic</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = \\alpha \\cdot \\text{lexical} + (1-\\alpha) \\cdot \\text{semantic}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lexical</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">semantic</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 由该语言评测集扫描。</li>\n<li><strong>用排名融合替代分数融合</strong>：RRF（Reciprocal Rank Fusion）只用排名不用分数，天然规避量级差异。它的形式是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>rank</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\frac{1}{k + \\text{rank}_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2902em;vertical-align:-0.4451em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rank</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4451em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 常取 60。多语言场景下 RRF 的优势明显，代价是丢失分数的细粒度信息。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>跨语言向量检索本身（用什么模型、如何对齐语言空间）属于 <code>13_cross-language-retrieval</code> hub 的范围，这里只处理融合权重这一层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习排序-为什么必须分-locale\">学习排序：为什么必须分 locale</h2><p>学习排序（LTR）用标注数据训练一个排序模型，把多路特征（BM25 分、向量相似度、销量、点击率等）组合成最终排序。它在多语言场景下有一个硬约束：<strong>训练数据必须按 locale 分开，模型也必须按 locale 部署</strong>（或至少在特征里显式包含 locale 并让模型学到交互项）。</p>\n<p>理由有三个层面：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>特征分布不同</strong>。同一个 BM25 特征在日语与泰语上的值域不同（受词项数量与 IDF 尺度影响），用一个模型处理会学到错误的分段点。</li>\n<li><strong>标注标准不同</strong>。相关性判断受语言与文化影响：某些市场对「规格匹配」敏感，另一些对「品牌匹配」更敏感。混在一起标注会互相污染。</li>\n<li><strong>样本量差异</strong>。大语言市场有充足的点击与标注数据，小语种市场样本稀少。小语种单独训练的模型会过拟合，此时更稳的做法是跨语言共享底层特征加该语言的小规模校准，而不是完全独立训练。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关于数据来源，LTR 的标注数据通常来自点击日志的隐式反馈，而隐式反馈在多语言下还有一层偏差：各语言市场的流量分布极不均衡，小语种市场的样本天然稀少。处理方式有两种——对稀缺语言使用跨语言迁移（用高资源语言训练的模型加少量本地样本微调），或对该语言直接退回手工调参的 BM25 加权，不做 LTR。后者在很多团队里是更务实的选择：<strong>没有足够本地样本时，手工调参的确定性高于训练出来的模型</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调参流程与回滚\">调参流程与回滚</h2><p>按语言调参不是一次性工作，而是一个有节奏的循环。可运转的流程是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>建立基线</strong>：为每个语言记录当前参数下的评测指标（见下一篇的评测方法）。</li>\n<li><strong>定位瓶颈</strong>：把语言按指标分组，找出指标显著低于大盘的语言。常见的差异来源是分词质量（CJK、泰语）、识别错误（混写）、或权重不匹配（小语种被大语种参数覆盖）。</li>\n<li><strong>单变量调整</strong>：一次只改一个参数维度（一个字段的 boost、或一个语言的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>），在预发集群跑该语言评测集。</li>\n<li><strong>判断显著性</strong>：指标变化需要与评测集自身的噪声量级比较。用查询级别的配对比较或多次采样评估置信区间，避免把噪声当提升。</li>\n<li><strong>小流量上线</strong>：按语言维度灰度，观察线上指标（点击率、转化率、零结果率）。</li>\n<li><strong>回滚准备</strong>：权重表与 similarity 配置都应有版本与一键回滚；similarity 改动需要重建索引，因此必须走索引别名切换而不是原地改。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 4 步在多语言调参中尤其重要，因为单个语言的评测集通常不大，指标波动本就明显。用「同一批查询在不同参数下配对比较」的方式能显著降低所需样本量，这是把小语种调参做成可持续工作的关键技巧。评测集的组织与指标解读见 <a href=\"evaluating-multilingual\">各语言分别建相关性评测集</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>按语言可调的参数分四层：字段 boost、BM25 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>、function_score、学习排序；应按此顺序推进，收益递减而复杂度递增。</li>\n<li>按语言调权重的前提是查询链路能拿到 locale 且权重表可外部配置；硬编码权重等于把运营调参变成代码发布。</li>\n<li>字段 boost 是相对量，同比例放大等于没变；应固定基准字段为 1.0，每次只调一个维度。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 调小适合词项数波动大的 CJK bigram 字段，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 调大适合词项数稳定的德语；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对短标题字段可调小。具体值由评测扫描确定。</li>\n<li>能在字段 boost 表达的不要用脚本打分，脚本会失去查询优化并增加覆盖评测的难度。</li>\n<li>词法与向量混合时，固定融合权重会让某些语言被单一信号支配；按语言校准 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 或用 RRF 排名融合可规避。</li>\n<li>LTR 必须分 locale 训练与部署，因为特征分布、标注标准、样本量三者都随语言不同；小语种样本不足时应退回手工调参而非训练模型。</li>\n<li>调参循环是「基线—定位—单变量调整—显著性判断—灰度—回滚」，其中用小语种配对比较降低样本需求是可持续的关键。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"按语言调相关性权重","id":"按语言调相关性权重"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"字段 boost 与权重表","id":"字段-boost-与权重表"},{"level":2,"text":"按语言设置 BM25 参数","id":"按语言设置-bm25-参数"},{"level":2,"text":"function_score 与脚本打分的边界","id":"function_score-与脚本打分的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"学习排序：为什么必须分 locale","id":"学习排序-为什么必须分-locale"},{"level":2,"text":"调参流程与回滚","id":"调参流程与回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分析器如何改变 BM25 打分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multilingual-search-engineering/relevance-i18n/analysis-affects-scoring"},"next":{"title":"各语言分别建相关性评测集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multilingual-search-engineering/relevance-i18n/evaluating-multilingual"}}